{'symbol': 'AMD', 'date': '2021-05-17 09:00:00', 'title': "AMD TO KEYNOTE J.P. MORGAN'S 49TH ANNUAL GLOBAL TECHNOLOGY, MEDIA AND COMMUNICATIONS CONFERENCE", 'text': 'SANTA CLARA, CALIF., MAY 17, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- TODAY, AMD (NASDAQ: AMD) ANNOUNCED THAT DR. LISA SU, PRESIDENT AND CEO, WILL PROVIDE A KEYNOTE PRESENTATION AT THE J.P. MORGAN 49TH ANNUAL GLOBAL TECHNOLOGY, MEDIA AND COMMUNICATIONS CONFERENCE ON MONDAY, MAY 24, 2021 AT 8:45 AM ET/5:45 AM PT.'}